      "detailed_description": "<h1>Play Best Elf</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Best Elf is an erotic 2D visual novel spinoff of Faulty Apprentice, following Eleanna and Zariinna. </h2><br>When an innocent competition between the two elves turns into a rescue mission, it's up to you and your friends to save the day! With two sexy elves at your side, what could go wrong?<br><br><i>The timeline of Faulty Apprentice: Best Elf takes place according to the true good ending of Faulty Apprentice. <strong>It is a standalone visual novel</strong>.</i></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><strong>Faulty Apprentice Downloadable Contents all contains full body nudity, erotic dialogue, and consensual sexual act.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/ELEANNA.GIF?t=1699503694\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Faulty Apprentice?</h2>Faulty Apprentice is an interactive visual novel set in a medieval fantasy world, featuring character relationships, minigames, and a riveting blend of suspenseful drama and comedy. Take on the task of defending a Castle full of virtuous maidens against an evil warlock and his legion of gruesome goblins! <i>You've got twenty days to prepare for battle!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><u>10+ DATEABLE characters</u></strong>! Each characters with their own story + several possible endings!<br></li><li><strong><u>STORY</u> <i>or</i> <u>CHALLENGE MODE</u></strong>- Enjoy the story <i>without</i> the minigame!<br></li><li><strong><u>Safe For Work</u></strong>- Fully censored + safe to stream! <strong><u>Light Ecchi with <i>fanservice.</i></u></strong> *Uncensored DLC available on Steam.<br></li><li>40+ stunning event CG to collect through gameplay and view during <strong><u>Gallery Mode</u></strong>!<br></li><li><strong><u>Skip-Mode</u></strong>- Skip texts and adjust the speed of dialogues for your New Game+ playthrough! <br></li><li><strong><u>20 Days</u></strong>- Allow more freedom and stat building! <i>*You will need to reach Day 20 and save your game to play DLC!</i></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/cd42bc52e0b0bdb2ef968f3c60c7fdae.poster.avif?t=1699503694\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/cd42bc52e0b0bdb2ef968f3c60c7fdae.webm?t=1699503694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/cd42bc52e0b0bdb2ef968f3c60c7fdae.mp4?t=1699503694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><strong>RELATIONSHIP PATHS</strong><br>10 Romance-able characters! Each of the instructors has their own minigames and personality quirks. Depending on who you spend time <i>Training</i> with, or doing <i>Jobs </i>for, will determine their role in the <i>Final Battle.</i> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/ZARIINNA.GIF?t=1699503694\" /></span><br><strong>GOOD vs. EVIL</strong><br>Will you inspire others for good or tempt them into evil? The choices you make will not only affect your fate but the fate of those around you as well.<br><br><strong>MINIGAMES</strong><br>Training and Jobs are broken down into three categories, Archery, Swordsmanship, and Magic, each with unique gameplay! STORY or CHALLENGE MODE- Enables you to enjoy the story without the minigame!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/12e02a8106c7580bb199b2d19ab70646.poster.avif?t=1699503694\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https:/