store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/f3cd079ebf132ad7ebcb1b654b2df971.poster.avif?t=1699503694\" width=600 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/f3cd079ebf132ad7ebcb1b654b2df971.webm?t=1699503694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/630550/extras/f3cd079ebf132ad7ebcb1b654b2df971.mp4?t=1699503694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ARE YOU A GOOD FRIEND?</strong><br>Some routes of the game will lead to good, others to evil. Will you save the kingdom? Or will you bring about its destruction? The fate of Stars Reach Castle will be determined by you, the Faulty Apprentice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h2>Join the conversation here or Faulty Apprentice  Server, and let the AGL studios team know what you think of the game. We read all of the player's feedback!",
